# ---------------- PhysBullet.events (physics movement test) ----------------
# Setup: EventSheet on the PhysBullet RigidBody, "Use Physics Movement" ON.
# Body: dynamic, EnableGravity OFF, UseCCD ON, trigger SphereCollider child.
# The actor in the scene is the hidden template; `spawn PhysBullet at me` clones it.
#
# The manager also registers the sheet on the inactive template (so the opt-in flag
# survives the clone), so mark the template at scene start and gate the live logic
# off for it. Clones are spawned after scene start, so they never get the marker.

when me appears
  set my IsTemplate to false

when scene starts
  set my IsTemplate to true

# Re-aim every tick: a dynamic body keeps the LinearVelocity we set.
when every 0 seconds
  unless my IsTemplate is true
  move toward nearest PhysTarget speed 200

when me touches PhysTarget
  unless my IsTemplate is true
  send message "hit" to other
  destroy me

when me touches PhysSpike
  unless my IsTemplate is true
  destroy me

# Safety net so a missed bullet never lives forever.
when every 5 seconds
  unless my IsTemplate is true
  destroy me
